gre-killer Puss In Boots.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":976573,\"title\":\"Elemental\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Y1WNkd88JXmGfhtWR7dmDAo1T2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4fLZUr1e65hKPPVw0R3PmKFKxj1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a city where fire, water, land and air residents live together, a fiery young woman and a go-with-the-flow guy will discover something elemental: how much they have in common.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9880,\"title\":\"The Princess Diaries\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7axhsbEzFan6HQQ1aMOy7w3CFRx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ktPixrzD9Rbet7Co4uUWxyR9191.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A socially awkward but very bright 15-year-old girl being raised by a single mom discovers that she is the princess of a small European country because of the recent death of her long-absent father, who, unknown to her, was the crown prince of Genovia. She must make a choice between continuing the life of a San Francisco teen or stepping up to the throne.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4523,\"title\":\"Enchanted\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn't operate on a \\\"happily ever after\\\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11247,\"title\":\"A Cinderella Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ukwP7gDPWxj1R1dW5iN3mnxkL3D.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cxj7Fi2r1fjE8iM2jynhx4YF1Jb.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Routinely exploited by her wicked stepmother, the downtrodden Samantha Montgomery is excited about the prospect of meeting her Internet beau at the school's Halloween dance.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550205,\"title\":\"Wish Dragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lnPf6hzANL6pVQTxUlsNYSuhT5l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4kIRrW1AlHP5Idne8CPHeQt8nR5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Determined teen Din is longing to reconnect with his childhood best friend when he meets a wish-granting dragon who shows him the magic of possibilities.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11451,\"title\":\"Herbie Fully Loaded\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7lTfTZ8CDfXw09eAv3OOvsbCVgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u6qrMY2PIzXwmydmKNHmVDFbjaV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Maggie Peyton, the new owner of Number 53 - the free-wheelin' Volkswagen bug with a mind of its own - puts the car through its paces on the road to becoming a NASCAR competitor.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":512895,\"title\":\"Lady and the Tramp\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8wBEye516IKul9sW7JKGcFXVGfV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHNNKoqQOIWODk5mMyW8CvDisem.